OL,3,GNEWSAMan who urinated on hospice's
OL,4,Aelephant statue jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who threw a brick and urinated on
OL,7,Fan elephant statue put on display as
OL,8,Fpart of a hospice's fundraising appeal
OL,9,Fhas been jailed for 16 weeks.
OL,11,FFaisal Mohammed, 31, was caught on CCTV
OL,12,Frepeatedly damaging Hidden Treasures in
OL,13,Fthe early hours of 18 July, near The
OL,14,FCurve in William Street, Slough.
OL,16,FThe artwork was placed there as part of
OL,17,FThames Hospice's Trunks Across the
OL,18,FThames appeal. The charity placed 30
OL,19,Fdecorated elephants around Slough and
OL,20,FMaidenhead over the summer.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
