OL,3,GNEWSAMan who urinated on hospice's
OL,4,Aelephant statue jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FMohammed, of no fixed address, admitted
OL,7,Fat Slough Magistrates' Court to
OL,8,Fcriminal damage against the statue,
OL,9,Fwhich was decorated by artist Millery
OL,10,FWheeler, and outraging public decency.
